  <body>
    <main class="page-shell policy-page">
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Hacks squared home"><span class="mark">H²</span><span>Hacks² / Applied AI</span></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="/workflows/">Workflows</a><a href="/tools/">Tools</a><a href="/notes/">Field Notes</a></div><span class="nav-menu">Policy / 001</span></nav>
      <article class="policy-content">
        <p class="hero-kicker"><span class="pulse"></span> Last updated / 31 July 2026</p>
        <h1>DIGITAL PRODUCT<br /><em>REFUND POLICY.</em></h1>
        <p class="policy-lead">This policy applies to paid digital products sold by Hacks², including the AI Business Operations Pack.</p>
        <h2>Digital delivery</h2>
        <p>Paid products are digital files or digital content delivered immediately after successful payment. No physical product is shipped.</p>
        <h2>Right of withdrawal</h2>
        <p>For customers in the European Economic Area, digital content supplied immediately after purchase may not be eligible for the standard 14-day withdrawal period once supply has begun and the customer has expressly consented to immediate delivery and acknowledged that this can affect the withdrawal right. The checkout must collect that consent before delivery.</p>
        <h2>When a refund is appropriate</h2>
        <p>Hacks² will review a refund request when a file cannot be accessed or is materially different from its description and the issue cannot be resolved. Requests should be made within 14 days of purchase and include the email used for the order and a short description of the issue.</p>
        <h2>Not a guarantee of results</h2>
        <p>The packs provide educational workflows, prompts and templates. They do not guarantee business results, time savings, revenue, regulatory compliance or suitability for a particular use case. The buyer remains responsible for reviewing outputs and decisions.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Contact details for purchase support will be shown in the Stripe receipt and checkout before payment. Please keep the receipt available when requesting help.</p>
      </article>
      <footer class="footer"><span>© 2026 Hacks²</span><span>Built for applied intelligence</span><a href="/disclosure/">Editorial disclosure</a></footer>
    </main>
